description=All-in-One bare-metal undervolt: CPU (-50mV, 200MHz floor), GPU (-50mV, 1068MHz@800mV), and DVFSRC Vcore (OPP 0 capped at 650mV / -75mV via hardware & regulator clamp). Includes automatic vendor_boot backup and restore.
